   "html": "<p>We kicked off this project by bringing the in-world photo experience to San Diego Comic-Con, where fans, the press, and the film’s cast enjoyed the booth before entering the inaugural screening hosted by Collider. It was such a hit that Disney invited us back for a second round of fun at the film’s red carpet premiere, where guests, including Paula Abdul and Jack Quaid enjoyed the booth! </p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "PHOTO MOMENT",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>The build-out featured a fabricated custom set made up of several decaying trees and debris, with a printed backdrop of the film’s Predator. Guests instantly received their images, which included a fog animation overlay to add an extra layer of mystery. Content captured with the film’s talent was also shared on HULU, 20th Century Studios, and Predator social channels.</p>"
    },
